  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Readmission Capacity Building Facility (EURCAP) - Phase III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The EU Readmission Capacity Building Facility (EURCAP) provides a dedicated and flexible mechanism to respond quickly to short-term requests for assistance to partner countries (&#x201c;support actions&#x201d;) in three types of situations; a) to support on-going negotiations of EU readmission agreements; b) to support the implementation of EU agreements in force; c) to support cooperation with countries , which- even if  no readmission agreement is in place or discussed - are prioritised by the EU for cooperation on return and readmission.</narrative>
  </description>
